WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Choose single artwork, repeated layout, multiple-image layout or a custom canvas, depending on the production step you need.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:23.000
For single artwork, review dimensions, resolution, white-ink choke and margins, then export TIFF.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:27.500
Single artwork is ready. Continue to the next step.

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:39.800
For repeated layouts, set artwork dimensions, layout width and area. Allow enough space for the complete artwork, then generate the layout.

00:00:39.800 --> 00:00:47.000
Inspect the complete layout in Photoshop, checking every image and its boundaries.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:55.800
Finally, generate the white-ink channel and export TIFF. This stage uses the existing layout without adding margins again.
